implementer|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Write, Edit|sonnet
reviewer|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash|opus
story-reviewer|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash|opus
tester|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash|haiku
pr-agent|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Edit|haiku
retro-agent|Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, Write|opus
